{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Start small. Think big. Grow forever.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Begin with a single, modest generator. Just enough to get the lights on. Reinvest your earnings, unlock new technologies, and expand your operation step by step. Before you know it, you\u2019re running a power production empire, earning mind-boggling amounts of money and breaking records with every reset.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrade constantly</strong><br>Chase new milestones, unlock fresh tech, and keep your production climbing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Prestige for more power</strong><br>Reset your progress to gain lasting bonuses and open new strategies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Earn while away</strong><br>Keep making progress even when the game is closed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play your way</strong><br>Drop in for quick sessions or settle in for long optimization runs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enjoy worldwide support</strong><br>Available in English, Simplified Chinese, Japanese, Korean, Portuguese, Russian, French, German, Italian, and Spanish.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3945350/extras/986226ef292fdbeba8d7cbc914c89d64.poster.avif?t=1756331649\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3945350/extras/986226ef292fdbeba8d7cbc914c89d64.webm?t=1756331649\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3945350/extras/986226ef292fdbeba8d7cbc914c89d64.mp4?t=1756331649\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3945350?t=1756331649","background